OL,3,AFour dead and thousands without power
OL,4,Aafter Hurricane Isaias lashes US
OL,5,
OL,6,FIsaias made landfall in Florida on late
OL,7,FFriday with maximum sustained winds of
OL,8,F105 miles per hour (168 km/h) before
OL,9,Fbeing downgraded to a post-tropical
OL,10,Fcyclone.
